        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion F2, Round Traditional Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nA simple deadbolt, Fusion's Contoured Radius Deadbolt is made out of solid brass and is available in 5 finishes--making it easily transformed to go with almost any style home. It is available in either a single cylinder or a double cylinder Grade 2 deadbolt.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Fusion F2 Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>1\" Throw Bolt With Interior Roll Pins</li>\r\n<li>Heavy-Duty strike with 3 screws for added security.</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass schlage SC1 keyway & 5 pin system.</li>\r\n<li>Meets ANSI 156.5 Grade 2 Criteria.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Cambridge Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable Door Thickness 1-3/8\" and 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Limited Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder</b> -  The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from exterior and by a thumb turn from the interior.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Cylinder</b> - The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from both the exterior and the interior.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Traditional Cambridge Round Deadbolt, Fusion F2",
                "description": "Traditional Deadbolt Fusion F2 - With a classic round design, Fusion Hardware's Traditional Deadbolt is constructed out of solid brass. It meets ANSI 156.5 Grade 2 criteria. It features a heavy-duty strike with 3 screws for added security. Available in 5 finishes.",
